From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 18:44:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7925: skip a polled link without a station

Upstream: https://github.com/openwrt/mt76/commit/268c4da0ab0029c5b2024e049f19a591438851fe
Fixes: 52f088a2e6bf ("wifi: mt76: mt7925: move WCID teardown into link_sta_remove()")
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20261120174459.1657382-7-nbd@nbd.name
Signed-off-by: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>

diff --git a/mt7925/mac.c b/mt7925/mac.c
index d0e207f..0e20dd6 100644
--- a/mt7925/mac.c
+++ b/mt7925/mac.c
@@ -87,7 +87,7 @@ static void mt7925_mac_sta_poll(struct mt792x_dev *dev)
 			memset(mlink->airtime_ac, 0, sizeof(mlink->airtime_ac));
 		}
 
-		if (!mlink->wcid.sta)
+		if (!msta || !mlink->wcid.sta)
 			continue;
 
 		sta = container_of((void *)msta, struct ieee80211_sta,
